========== Credible interval quality (Bayesian methods only) ==========
  method n_sims coverage_95 mean_ci_width mean_diag
     ABC     20          85     2.084e+04    0.8522
 ABC-SMC     20          90     8.817e-02  148.2971
coverage_95 should be near 95%. Well below = overconfident intervals;
well above = intervals too wide to be useful. mean_diag is the chain
acceptance rate for ABC and the effective sample size for ABC-SMC.

